OL,4,BThe Chelsea loanee turning heads and   
OL,5,BChampionship defenders at 17           
OL,6,GExplosive pace, infectious energy on   
OL,7,Gthe field and bundles of footballing   
OL,8,Gability.                               
OL,10,FAt just 17, Ryan Kavuma-McQueen has    
OL,11,Flooked at home in the Championship     
OL,12,Fsince embarking on his first loan move 
OL,13,Faway from Chelsea.                     
OL,15,FWith one senior appearance to his name 
OL,16,Fat Stamford Bridge, the winger swapped 
OL,17,Fwest London for the south coast in     
OL,18,FAugust and has quickly become a fan    
OL,19,Ffavourite at Fratton Park.             
